---
interface Props {
  locale: string;
}

const { locale } = Astro.props;
---

<div class="min-h-screen bg-white pt-20">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 py-16 max-w-4xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-500 mb-12">Last updated: December 31, 2025</p>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          This is an independent information website created for educational and research purposes. We are not affiliated with Google, xAI, OpenAI, Midjourney, or any other AI company referenced on this site.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          This Privacy Policy explains how we handle information when you visit our website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We collect minimal information:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
          <li>IP address and device information (automatically collected)</li>
          <li>Browser type and version</li>
          <li>Usage patterns and page views</li>
          <li>Cookies and similar tracking technologies</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">3. How We Use Information</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          We use collected information for:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
          <li>Analyzing website traffic and usage patterns</li>
          <li>Improving website performance and content</li>
          <li>Complying with legal obligations</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">4. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          Our website contains links to third-party websites and official resources. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these external sites. We encourage you to review their privacy policies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">5. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance your experience. You can control cookie preferences through your browser settings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new policy on this page and updating the "Last updated" date.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">7. Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:
        </p>
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <p class="text-gray-700">Email: support@clawd-bot.com</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mt-2">Website: https://clawd-bot.com</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-6 rounded">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700">
          <strong>Disclaimer:</strong> This website is an independent information resource. We are not affiliated with Google, xAI, OpenAI, Midjourney, or any other AI company referenced on this site. All model details, benchmarks, and comparisons are compiled from publicly available sources, official documentation, and reputable third-party evaluations.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
